#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:8
msgid "运行第一个 Native 应用"
msgstr "Run the first Native application"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:10
msgid ""
"本教程在 Linux 主机上运行一个 C11 GPIO／UART 应用，观察一次传输结清和平台停止。 Native "
"是软件模型，需要显式启用测试支撑；本教程不运行平台完整维护测试图。"
msgstr ""
"This tutorial runs a C11 GPIO/UART application on a Linux host and observes "
"one transfer settling followed by platform stop. Native is a software model "
"requiring explicit test support. This tutorial does not execute the complete"
" platform maintenance test graph."

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:13
msgid "准备输入"
msgstr "Prepare inputs"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:15
msgid ""
"需要 Git、Python 3.11+、CMake 3.31+、Ninja 和主机 C 编译器。按 [获取源码](../guides/source-"
"checkout.md)取得平台与公开示例仓库，记录所选提交。 设置路径和示例仓库的完整提交；`PRODUCT_DIR` 必须尚不存在："
msgstr ""
"You need Git, Python 3.11+, CMake 3.31+, Ninja and a host C compiler. Obtain"
" the platform and public examples repository using [source "
"retrieval](../guides/source-checkout.md), and record both selected commits. "
"Set the paths and full examples commit. `PRODUCT_DIR` must not already "
"exist:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:26
msgid "示例模板的提交与平台提交各自记录。创建器检查模板清单及接口代际，不根据相同版本号 猜测它们是同一份源码。"
msgstr ""
"Record the examples-template commit separately from the platform commit. The"
" creator checks the template manifest and interface epochs; it does not "
"assume matching version strings identify the same source."

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:29
msgid "创建与准备"
msgstr "Create and prepare"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:31
msgid "从任意工作目录执行："
msgstr "Run from any working directory:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:42
msgid ""
"创建器复制维护的 CMake、TOML、C 源和编辑器配置，解析所选装配，并保存 `.nexus-"
"template.json`。输出目录已存在、模板变更或配置拒绝时，先处理诊断。 最小 Native 应用没有外部 Git 运行依赖；需要网络、TLS "
"等组件时，准备器按 TOML 选择供应方，显式加 `--allow-network` 才允许获取它们。"
msgstr ""
"The creator copies maintained CMake, TOML, C source and editor "
"configuration, resolves the selected assembly, and saves `.nexus-"
"template.json`. If the output exists, template bytes have changed or "
"configuration is rejected, handle the diagnostic first. A minimal Native "
"application has no external Git runtime dependencies. When components such "
"as networking or TLS are selected, the preparer chooses suppliers from the "
"TOML; fetching requires explicit `--allow-network`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:47
msgid "编译与运行"
msgstr "Compile and run"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:56
msgid "成功时 `starter_application` 通过，直接运行生成的程序也会输出："
msgstr ""
"On success, `starter_application` passes. Running the generated program "
"directly also prints:"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:62
msgid ""
"这条路径执行真实应用 C，UART 由模型提供。模板使用静态请求和 payload，只有请求 真正结清后才停止平台。Native UART "
"不连接主机串口。"
msgstr ""
"This path executes real application C, with UART supplied by a model. The "
"template uses static request and payload storage and stops the platform only"
" after the request has actually settled. Native UART does not connect to a "
"host serial port."

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:65
msgid ""
"打开 `main.c`、`assembly.toml` 和 `.nexus-template.json`，分别查看执行、选择与来源。 修改应用 C "
"后重跑 build；修改 TOML 后先检查配置，再重跑 build。"
msgstr ""
"Open `main.c`, `assembly.toml` and `.nexus-template.json` to inspect "
"execution, selection and provenance respectively. After changing application"
" C, rerun the build. After changing TOML, check configuration before "
"rebuilding."

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:68
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next steps"

#: ../../../../../../docs/tutorials/first-native.md:70
msgid ""
"给现有应用增加接口见[应用配置](../guides/app-configuration.md)；理解请求与执行者见 [I/O "
"执行](../guides/io-execution.md)；构建 MCU 镜像见 [第一个 F407 "
"工程](first-f407.md)。安装包消费见 [使用 Source SDK](../guides/use-source-sdk.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [application configuration](../guides/app-configuration.md) to add "
"interfaces, [I/O execution](../guides/io-execution.md) to understand "
"requests and executors, and [the first F407 project](first-f407.md) to build"
" an MCU image. For an installed package, see [use a Source "
"SDK](../guides/use-source-sdk.md)."
